      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To target impulsivity, ask scenarios requiring quick, high-stakes decisions under perceived street pressure. For language/slang, you might ask participants to describe a high-stress social interaction using various levels of formality. To gauge authority handling, present a scenario where an authority figure's command conflicts with a perceived community need and observe their inclination to comply or resist. It is crucial to validate these measures culturally to ensure they reflect behaviors rather than mere dialect.",
